    "title": "Free NZ Road Code Quizzes for Your Car Licence Test",
    "description": "Official Road Code questions to practice for your restricted / learner driver's licence for car",
    "content": "<div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-8\">\n  <h2 class=\"mb-6 text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900\">Learning Modules</h2>\n\n  <div class=\"grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\">\n    <a href=\"/roadcode/car/core/62/\" class=\"block rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white p-4 shadow-sm transition hover:shadow-md\">\n      <div class=\"flex h-full flex-col\">\n        <div class=\"mb-4\">\n          <img src=\"https://www.drivingtests.co.nz/media/module-images/core-road-code.jpg\" alt=\"Core\" class=\"h-40 w-full rounded-md object-cover\">\n        </div>\n        <h3 class=\"mb-4 text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900\">Core</h3>\n        <div class=\"mt-auto flex items-center justify-between gap-4\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-600\">\n            <span aria-hidden=\"true\">⏱</span>\n            <span>12 minutes</span>\n          </div>\n          <span class=\"rounded bg-blue-600 px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-white\">Begin module</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </a>\n\n    <a href=\"/roadcode/car/behaviour/87/\" class=\"block rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white p-4 shadow-sm transition hover:shadow-md\">\n      <div class=\"flex h-full flex-col\">\n        <div class=\"mb-4\">\n          <img src=\"https://www.drivingtests.co.nz/media/module-images/behaviour.jpg\" alt=\"Behaviour\" class=\"h-40 w-full rounded-md object-cover\">\n        </div>\n        <h3 class=\"mb-4 text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900\">Behaviour</h3>\n        <div class=\"mt-auto flex items-center justify-between gap-4\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-600\">\n            <span aria-hidden=\"true\">⏱</span>\n            <span>15 minutes</span>\n          </div>\n          <span class=\"rounded bg-blue-600 px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-white\">Begin module</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </a>\n\n    <a href=\"/roadcode/car/parking/19/\" class=\"block rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white p-4 shadow-sm transition hover:shadow-md\">\n      <div class=\"flex h-full flex-col\">\n        <div class=\"mb-4\">\n          <img src=\"https://www.drivingtests.co.nz/media/module-images/parking.jpg\" alt=\"Parking\" class=\"h-40 w-full rounded-md object-cover\">\n        </div>\n        <h3 class=\"mb-4 text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900\">Parking</h3>\n        <div class=\"mt-auto flex items-center justify-between gap-4\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-600\">\n            <span aria-hidden=\"true\">⏱</span>\n            <span>5 minutes</span>\n          </div>\n          <span class=\"rounded bg-blue-600 px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-white\">Begin module</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </a>\n\n    <a href=\"/roadcode/car/emergencies/16/\" class=\"block rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white p-4 shadow-sm transition hover:shadow-md\">\n      <div class=\"flex h-full flex-col\">\n        <div class=\"mb-4\">\n          <img src=\"https://www.drivingtests.co.nz/media/module-images/emergencies.jpg\" alt=\"Emergencies\" class=\"h-40 w-full rounded-md object-cover\">\n        </div>\n        <h3 class=\"mb-4 text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900\">Emergencies</h3>\n        <div class=\"mt-auto flex items-center justify-between gap-4\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-600\">\n            <span aria-hidden=\"true\">⏱</span>\n            <span>6 minutes</span>\n          </div>\n          <span class=\"rounded bg-blue-600 px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-white\">Begin module</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </a>\n\n    <a href=\"/roadcode/car/road-position/18/\" class=\"block rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white p-4 shadow-sm transition hover:shadow-md\">\n      <div class=\"flex h-full flex-col\">\n        <div class=\"mb-4\">\n          <img src=\"https://www.drivingtests.co.nz/media/module-images/road-position.jpg\" alt=\"Road position\" class=\"h-40 w-full rounded-md object-cover\">\n        </div>\n        <h3 class=\"mb-4 text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900\">Road position</h3>\n        <div class=\"mt-auto flex items-center justify-between gap-4\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-600\">\n            <span aria-hidden=\"true\">⏱</span>\n            <span>5 minutes</span>\n          </div>\n          <span class=\"rounded bg-blue-600 px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-white\">Begin module</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </a>\n\n    <a href=\"/roadcode/car/intersection/78/\" class=\"block rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white p-4 shadow-sm transition hover:shadow-md\">\n      <div class=\"flex h-full flex-col\">\n        <div class=\"mb-4\">\n          <img src=\"https://www.drivingtests.co.nz/media/module-images/intersection.jpg\" alt=\"Intersection\" class=\"h-40 w-full rounded-md object-cover\">\n        </div>\n        <h3 class=\"mb-4 text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900\">Intersection</h3>\n        <div class=\"mt-auto flex items-center justify-between gap-4\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-600\">\n            <span aria-hidden=\"true\">⏱</span>\n            <span>13 minutes</span>\n          </div>\n          <span class=\"rounded bg-blue-600 px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-white\">Begin module</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </a>\n\n    <a href=\"/roadcode/car/theory/33/\" class=\"block rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white p-4 shadow-sm transition hover:shadow-md\">\n      <div class=\"flex h-full flex-col\">\n        <div class=\"mb-4\">\n          <img src=\"https://www.drivingtests.co.nz/media/module-images/theory.jpg\" alt=\"Theory\" class=\"h-40 w-full rounded-md object-cover\">\n        </div>\n        <h3 class=\"mb-4 text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900\">Theory</h3>\n        <div class=\"mt-auto flex items-center justify-between gap-4\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-600\">\n            <span aria-hidden=\"true\">⏱</span>\n            <span>8 minutes</span>\n          </div>\n          <span class=\"rounded bg-blue-600 px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-white\">Begin module</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </a>\n\n    <a href=\"/roadcode/car/signs/54/\" class=\"block rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white p-4 shadow-sm transition hover:shadow-md\">\n      <div class=\"flex h-full flex-col\">\n        <div class=\"mb-4\">\n          <img src=\"https://www.drivingtests.co.nz/media/module-images/signs.jpg\" alt=\"Signs\" class=\"h-40 w-full rounded-md object-cover\">\n        </div>\n        <h3 class=\"mb-4 text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900\">Signs</h3>\n        <div class=\"mt-auto flex items-center justify-between gap-4\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-600\">\n            <span aria-hidden=\"true\">⏱</span>\n            <span>11 minutes</span>\n          </div>\n          <span class=\"rounded bg-blue-600 px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-white\">Begin module</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </a>\n  </div>\n\n  <aside class=\"mt-8 space-y-4\">\n    <div id=\"DT_Sidebar_1\"></div>\n    <div id=\"DT_Sidebar_2\"></div>\n    <div id=\"DT_Sidebar_3\"></div>\n  </aside>\n\n  <div class=\"mt-8\">\n    <div id=\"DT_Leaderboard_BTF_2\"></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"mt-8 text-gray-700\">\n    <p class=\"mb-4\">These modules cover all the Road Code questions you need to prepare for your <strong>car learner licence test.</strong></p>\n\n    <ul class=\"mb-6 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6\">\n      <li><strong>Core:</strong> Essential Road Code knowledge, including following and passing regulations and give-way requirements.</li>\n      <li><strong>Behaviour:</strong> Courteous driving practices and managing difficult road conditions.</li>\n      <li><strong>Parking:</strong> Parking restrictions and regulations, including where different vehicles may or may not park and the applicable time limits, such as those in loading zones.</li>\n      <li><strong>Emergencies:</strong> How to respond to skids, mechanical breakdowns, crashes and obstacles, as well as how to pass emergency vehicles safely.</li>\n      <li><strong>Road position:</strong> Correctly positioning your vehicle in various situations, including overtaking and approaching intersections.</li>\n      <li><strong>Intersections:</strong> Understanding traffic lights, stop signs and give-way signs at T-intersections, crossroads, roundabouts and other junctions.</li>\n      <li><strong>Theory:</strong> Warrant of fitness and registration requirements, lawful loads and passenger safety.</li>\n      <li><strong>Signs:</strong> Road signs covering speed limits, road works, mandatory and advisory instructions, hazards and directions.</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <p class=\"mb-4\">Work through these practice tests until you consistently achieve 100%. Once you can do that, you should be ready for the actual theory test. Be sure to create an account so you can monitor your progress.</p>\n\n    <p class=\"mb-4\">A car licence allows you to drive most light vehicles, including cars, vans and utes, as well as ATVs, some agricultural vehicles, motorhomes and campers depending on their weight, and mopeds with a maximum engine capacity of 50cc. If you are visiting New Zealand and plan to hire a car or motorhome, take time to learn the Road Code using the free quizzes above, especially the sections on signs and intersection rules.</p>\n\n    <p>If you are studying the New Zealand Road Code for the learner licence theory test, this website can be used on a computer, tablet or smartphone. Save it to your phone so you can complete the quizzes shortly before the real test, keeping the information fresh in your short-term memory.</p>\n  </div>\n</div>",
